SUMMARY:Energy in Motion
DESCRIPTION:Imagine a world where energy transforms from one form to another\, setting objects into motion and spin. How does movement begin? How does it transfer? What makes some objects spin faster or stronger? Join us for an experience where you explore scientific ideas through fun\, hands-on motion activities that reveal the secrets of rotation and energy transfer in the systems around us.
